{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_01",
  "title": "埋藏",
  "storyCode": "DM-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3b31fc9bc857f94ded49339d5375c126eac137ec7608bdef302f9b7b1ed9ce75",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是我。\n已經抵達目標地點，肉眼確認到信號煙座標。\n......很久沒有和同行打交道，稍微有點損失。\n但是他們在地下發報站藏著的物資也很充裕，好歹能挽回一些。\n嗯，是的，斥候可以先出發了。\n我會儘快。\n......對了，有個意料之外的損失。\nW死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......說的那麼慘不忍睹，結果還不是四肢健全地回來了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "還是說，你只不過是想用苦肉計邀功？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "那麼你也大可不必離開營地來接應我們，你不需要這麼擔心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "我不擔心任何人，別自作多情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "如果不是W殿後為我們創造機會，我們誰也逃不出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......什麼時候的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "兩小時前，通訊被隔斷的時候，小隊遭到了埋伏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "W摧毀了廢墟，然後我們逃了出來，他死戰到了最後一刻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "可惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......的確，如果他能活著回到營地，按人頭來算，他會超過我成為這裡最值錢的雇傭兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "算了，事到如今說這些也沒意義，至少他不用再打仗了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "敵人已經撤退，要去回收嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "不可能，重新深入的風險太大，誰也承擔不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "怎麼？莫非你們關係很好？我怎麼不知道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "我只是可惜他身上的戰利品。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "沒什麼特別的，有些人的藏品比他豐富得多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "等這場戰爭結束，我們有的是機會重操舊業。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......如果會結束的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "哼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "互相安慰的話之後再說。日落前我們要離開這裡，再停留下去會成為眾矢之的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "回營地去，立刻整隊出發。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "哼——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "你這是在命令我？赫德雷“副”隊長？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......其他小隊都失去聯繫，現在總指揮權輪替在我手上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "我們平起平坐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......伊內絲，我們趕緊離開這裡，回到據點，然後聯繫雇主，重新商談一下報酬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "這只是建議，不是命令，好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "哼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "W的死，能給我們加上多少籌碼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "他是一名優秀的雇傭兵，明碼標價的優秀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "那至少他......不算白白送死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "他最後有沒有留下什麼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "——安靜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "有人靠近，三點鐘方向，不是我們的人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "——只有一個人，滾出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸的薩卡茲女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "薩卡茲......？本地人嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "不，不對，你手裡拿著的是W的刀和銃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "你是什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸的薩卡茲女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "不說話？那麼，死吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "她是跟著我們來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸的薩卡茲女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......你放任她跟蹤你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "我們的行進速度不慢，她在取得了W的遺物之後徒步跟上了我們，以她的身手，徒步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "她是個“有經驗”的薩卡茲，我想在撤離的時候也許會需要一個本地嚮導。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "——你在發什麼瘋？那不是更應該在這裡殺了她嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "你要是想害死我們所有人，大可直接動手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "我怎麼敢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "那如果她是個刺客呢？如果她把我們帶進佈好的陷阱裡呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "你知道卡茲戴爾有多少人想要你的腦袋嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "喔，有多少？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......你面前就有一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "你的頭非常值錢，只是暫且被我保存在你的脖子上而已，別太自以為是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "非常感謝你的勤儉，但是我也沒有開玩笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "她冒險撿起了W的刀，還有那把銃，然後正大光明地站在我們的面前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你的法術可以感覺到，她有敵意嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......腦子正常的人都不會突然接受一個來路不明的薩卡茲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "嗯，這就是你我不一樣的地方了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "一路上，我給過她很多次破綻，而她......向我扔了三次石子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "很有趣的示好方法，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......哈？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "按老規矩，也許我們應該給她一個機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "這場戰役造成了不少位置的空缺，比起用招募的手段招來一些同樣來歷不明的薩卡茲，我寧可，自己挑選。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸的薩卡茲女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "可她只是個外人，那套規矩也不該——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "——啊，算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "十分鐘後出發，我不在乎出發的是幾個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "但如果我還要額外處理一具屍體——不管是誰的，都建議你動作快點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "呵呵，真是沒耐心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......好了，你，認真聽我說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸的薩卡茲女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你拿著的是我們戰友的遺物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "放下這些東西，你可以活著離開這裡，然後死在其他隨便什麼地方，但至少會死得遲一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸的薩卡茲女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "最後一次機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸的薩卡茲女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸的薩卡茲女性",
      "text": "嗯......機會？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸的薩卡茲女性",
      "text": "......我從來不覺得我有選擇的餘地，轉過身的時候，你會出劍，我就會倒下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸的薩卡茲女性",
      "text": "從一開始......你的另一隻手，就搭在劍柄上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你也許見過我們，或者曾經為別人幹活，我不在乎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "但你知道接手戰死者的武器有何意義，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸的薩卡茲女性",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "那麼，優先準備撤退，詳細的之後再說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "現在先歸隊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "——“W”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "戰爭從未停止。我們的戰爭從未停止。\n就好像戰爭才是我們一直以來賴以生存的工具。\n......嗯，的確如此。\n有些人還在躊躇猶豫，有些人已經得心應手。後者生，前者死。\n而還有些人......天生就是這方面的好手。\n這倒是個意外之喜。\n在即將倒塌的廢墟裡見到她的第一眼開始，我就確信......\n她將會是最優秀的薩卡茲戰士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
